## Model card

- **Name:** Seed 2.0 Pro (ByteDance)
- **Short description:** ByteDance's proprietary "agent-era" flagship general model of the Seed 2.0 generation: complex reasoning, long-horizon multi-step planning, visual-text reasoning, hour-long video understanding, and tool-augmented execution (per vendor/DeepInfra model card).
- **Provider / access:** DeepInfra `deepinfra/ByteDance/Seed-2.0-pro` (repo-registered; partner model). Not on current OpenCode Zen; not tracked on Artificial Analysis.
- **Release / knowledge:** Seed 2.0 generation (2025/2026 lineage per AA family entries Seed-2.0-Lite/Mini, Seed 2.1 Pro/Turbo); exact release date for 2.0 Pro not verified here; knowledge cutoff not publicly stated.
- **IDs:** `deepinfra/ByteDance/Seed-2.0-pro` (no Zen ID; no Free ID).
- **Context window:** 256,000 tokens (DeepInfra model card; repo meta adds 65K max output).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video in; text out (DeepInfra "Multimodal"; vision input quality tiers low/high/xhigh; repo meta lists 256K/65K out).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-27):** $0.50 in / $3.00 out / $0.10 cached per 1M on DeepInfra (partner model).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary; parameter count not disclosed. Vendor claims: enterprise-grade agent orchestration, agentized coding, improved instruction following, upgraded multimodal/long-video/real-time video-stream understanding.

